"""One-shot patch: v15.67 -> v15.68 (Round 8: per-link pass loop fix).

The ?user=1 gates in stream_server._serve/_meta checked the auth token
ONLY against the global STREAM_PASS. A link unlocked with its own
per-link password got a token signed with THAT password — it satisfied
the r5 gates but never the user-account gate, so the page reloaded
into the password prompt forever ("correct password loops").

Fix: both gates now also accept a token signed with the link's own
password (r5_streampass.link_token_ok), and the K-2 anchors are
corrected so the r5 gates actually apply in _serve/_meta (the old
anchors never matched — addition G's telemetry sits between the gate
and _resolve, so only 3 of 4 edits ever landed).
"""
